[{"title":"谨所之赠王氏子","author":"陈淳","text":"我赠王氏子，作此谨所之。\n之子何所喜，喜有近道资。\n妙龄正弱冠，立志已不卑。\n与之语则解，知弗流俗随。\n今闻欲有行，问之如何其。\n曰取天下友，曰求天下师。\n斯言美则美，乃大人之为。\n在子则太早，恐非其所宜。\n去圣嗟已远，名家好相持。\n师者每异户，友焉亦多岐。\n志稚未坚定，焉保无转移。\n识嫩未的确，那知真是非。\n同人遽于野，懔乎其亦危。\n既慕圣贤学，须循圣贤规。\n圣功有次序，躐进徒尔疲。\n非益欲速成，孔深阙童讥。\n登高必自下，子思端不欺。\n道尔求诸远，孟轲尤所嗤。\n小学极纤悉，无非固骸肌。\n洒扫进退间，三千其威仪。\n子曾与周旋，有亏已无亏。\n大学入德门，纲条备无遗。\n开端在格物，大当致吾知。\n子曾与讲贯，有疑已无疑。\n语孟两部书，坦坦无峣崎。\n尽是平实语，中蕴至宝辉。\n子曾得其趣，抑尔猎其皮。\n入道贵有主，何须事支离。\n进德贵著实，何容慕新奇。\n后生所可畏，不在华藻摛。\n亦非记览博，亦匪谈辨飞。\n勇往识其正，路头不参差。\n终始一敬入，绝无傲岸私。\n驱车万里道，最谨发轫时。\n豪釐稍有差，千里谬莫追。\n志学错所学，从心竟相违。\n知止失所止，能得之者希。\n康庄大通衢，无用径捷窥。\n章韶大雅音，不必转调吹。\n美璞要成器，切戒浪琢锤。\n良苗善保养，粢盛方可期。\n惜兹少壮力，正宜自鞭治。\n一一务下学，俛焉日孜孜。\n圣门缜密功，不容漏毫丝。\n真积中欠缺，虚劳外奔驰。\n杂乎其胸臆，决堕狂与痴。\n不为子行喜，抑为子行悲。\n子既扣我门，吾何吝子医。\n不觉写肝肺，有此谆谆词。\n此理无强聒，姑以诚吾思。\n于乎王氏子，念我谨所之。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20645,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"遭族人横逆","author":"陈淳","text":"颜子有犯不之校，胸怀洒落冰雪融。\n孟轲横逆必自反，律己程度严秋霜。\n君子于物本无闷，小人胡尔好有攻。\n矧今薄俗抑又甚，绝无礼义争豪强。\n大伦大法毁瓦砾，小计小数横干将。\n背面反覆盖常态，是非毁誉无定章。\n朝为懿亲暮仇虏，外结同好中豺狼。\n奉之屈膝转摇尾，挤之下石仍挥枪。\n喜跻蹠蹻夷齐上，怒黜皋益共鲧傍。\n要之总总皆吾外，于我内者庸何伤。\n达人大观等毫毛，不为欣戚留心胸。\n刚应以柔逆以顺，噪应以静暴以恭。\n红炉点雪不少凝，曲直胜负何所量。\n况乎他石可攻玉，火经百鍊金始刚。\n坚吾志节熟吾仁，理义之益端无穷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20646,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题江郎庙六绝 其二","author":"陈淳","text":"缘尔江家兄弟三，平生爱此石岩岩。\n寓居石下多年代，陋俗因成附会谈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20647,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题盖竹庙六绝 其二","author":"陈淳","text":"梦生于想本来非，一自魂交百感随。\n漠漠茫茫无定准，若何据此卜前逵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20648,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠刘伯翔相师","author":"陈淳","text":"孔孟不说相，于人洞肺肝。\n由也行行如，不得其死然。\n括也未闻道，其躯难以全。\n赐亿亦屡中，执玉俯仰间。\n经礼视平衡，下忧倾则奸。\n兹皆以理决，初匪由术传。\n刘君以相名，表里须相关。\n备道最上格，温恭厉而安。\n晬面盎于背，德人盛容颜。\n论心勿徇形，心广体自胖。\n敬吉怠则灭，炳炳真如丹。\n此诀若未喻，所阅非神观。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20649,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"警惰","author":"陈淳","text":"日月双跳丸，一旦复一旦。\n于穆无疆命，后□□如趱。\n前头只逗遛，不勇攻与战。\n当然紧切功，一一事散漫。\n便是惰天职，天地一罪汉。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20650,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"警滞","author":"陈淳","text":"宾主辨贵白，死生路宜分。\n当克即便克，当存即必存。\n直须要脱洒，如彼霁月轮。\n超然物累上，无复渣滓浑。\n不须事黏滞，如咬老树根。\n弥年齧不断，岂不妨吾仁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20651,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"警懦","author":"陈淳","text":"颜子之克己，镆铘斫空桑。\n曾子毅于仁，重担硬脊梁。\n子路勇有行，劲兵赴敌场。\n孟轲刚不屈，砥柱立沧浪。\n嗟哉入圣门，迢迢万里长。\n傥非四子才，宁不中道僵。\n尔宜变尔质，变尔柔而刚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20652,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"征妇吟","author":"陈淳祖","text":"虏退沙场洗战斑，谁家不上望夫山。\n江边迤逦春无赖，杨柳枝垂人未还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20653,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过郑司业旧居","author":"陈淳祖","text":"司业閒居处，门前烟树低。\n见山怀旧隐，抚壁试新题。\n燕语花初落，蜂衙日自西。\n一年春事毕，又见子规啼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20654,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"重过惠泉","author":"陈淳祖","text":"何事笑痴儿，看山秋正宜。\n三年三到寺，一度一题诗。\n蜗篆避书壁，松钗落砚池。\n夜寒砧杵动，归思鬓先知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20655,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"海门","author":"陈淳祖","text":"微光动海门，色界一层新。\n玄雾横金阙，丹英吐玉津。\n长疑浴日处，上有饮霞人。\n顷刻晨烟合，纷纷乱野尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20656,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"劝农二首奉呈同官诸丈 其一","author":"陈淳祖","text":"劝农事云毕，晴日足登山。\n山高翠微上，坐见人境閒。\n天目有修眉，洞庭无狂澜。\n田畴井画见，布谷行相关。\n村村自花柳，流水春风颜。\n周行抚泉石，碧匣开潺湲。\n尚想读书声，犹在松树间。\n此事已难会，沂水何时还。\n朗吟苏仙语，明月下前湾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20657,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"劝农二首奉呈同官诸丈 其二","author":"陈淳祖","text":"乃一秋一冬，愁听鸿飞鸣。\n及兹问春半，土暖已足耕。\n殷勤劝父老，尊酒若为情。\n我有一瓣香，为尔祈西成。\n晴光动川原，桑麦日敷荣。\n天公幸见听，一饱须可营。\n几见陇亩事，得此白发生。\n田父饮我酒，归与儿孙评。\n孝弟力田者，家道终和平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20658,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"看云","author":"陈淳祖","text":"南山云欲归，北山云欲出。\n北山已成雨，南山还有日。\n天风忽吹举，南北山如一。\n白云本无心，不知果何术。\n出者未云得，归者未云失。\n茫茫古复今，世事却可说。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20659,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"慧日寺","author":"陈清","text":"秋入西山爽气生，烦襟涤尽渐神清。\n尘埃不到窗扉静，坐听幽林一鸟鸣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20660,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"茶庵观茶","author":"陈焕","text":"脚底晴雷殷殷过，浮山四面布干戈。\n鎗旗不染阴山血，留与人间战睡魔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20661,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花村咏梅作","author":"陈焕","text":"雪里溪桥独树春，客来惊起晓妆匀。\n试从意外看风味，方信留侯似妇人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20662,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄龙洞口道人送茶及筇竹杖","author":"陈焕","text":"露泣新芽九节筇，芽如雀舌节如龙。\n烹来习习风生腋，拄上罗浮第一峰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20663,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"遗衣坛","author":"陈焕","text":"一点残灯照夜阑，洞深云气逼人寒。\n仙翁从此乘鸾去，不见遗衣见古坛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20664,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"碧落洞","author":"陈焕子弟","text":"碧落他年访旧游，摩挲苍藓又从头。\n悬崖纵有诗千首，直许苏陈占上流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20665,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清溪","author":"陈章","text":"沧波万顷无纤尘，沙鸥两两来相亲。\n主人忘机鸥不去，此时此景皆天真。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20666,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"齐山 其二","author":"陈续","text":"携壶上翠微，雅致何今昔。\n谁知一笑间，俯仰成陈迹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20667,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"齐山 其一","author":"陈续","text":"齐山压清溪，苍崖浸老碧。\n山半古招提，高堂敞虚寂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20668,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"甲申仲冬侍亲由行在所还毗陵舟泊村渚","author":"陈翊","text":"日暮成孤泊，栖迟得小安。\n雪融沙觜露，云拂雁翎寒。\n过橹冰痕薄，通村水汊宽。\n诗情如废井，剩觉起微澜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20669,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜坐即事遣兴","author":"陈翊","text":"小阁暮云远，乱山黄叶稀。\n斗低天轴动，霜冷月魂飞。\n爱客樽常满，寻诗带减围。\n庭乌绕高树，游子亦思归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20670,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晓行","author":"陈翊","text":"客梦正无凭，喧呼睡不能。\n月移篷背雪，人远岸头灯。\n樯影浮寒水，篙声碎断冰。\n狸奴浑未觉，馀煖恋青绫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20671,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寒窗赋","author":"陈翊","text":"虚室玲珑别有天，晦明每被物情迁。\n几番黄叶送秋色，屡对青灯分夜烟。\n隙小风尖鸣淅沥，纸轻雪急响清圆。\n更阑人静疑无月，且与梅花借月眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20672,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"短篷","author":"陈翊","text":"水屋入花屿，春山来画图。\n片帆齐远树，落日半平芜。\n风紧溪声急，桥危岸势孤。\n薄游无一事，幽鸟唤提壶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20673,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和元耘轩赋木蕖来字韵","author":"陈翊","text":"碧树笼秋池，锦帐迎风开。\n水光曳倒影，矮菊纷舆台。\n春风木芍药，是花岂云来。\n淡妆绝脂粉，独秀墙之隈。\n彷佛秦与虢，上马犹徘徊。\n持以赠美人，斜插乌云堆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20674,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"借榻竹庵","author":"陈翊","text":"短筇穿秋云，杳霭杂雨意。\n林梢响脱叶，虹影挟夕霁。\n安栖一枝禅，静寄三径地。\n青薜蟠弱龙，紫栗缩寒猬。\n游息屏百营，偃仰得佳睡。\n靖惟天地间，岁月脱如蜕。\n三彭伐一真，六凿纷小智。\n居然蜗战角，在处牛穿鼻。\n驱驰赤白丸，百年等儿戏。\n岂知闲中天，意到即超诣。\n灯光续佛照，石响清夜气。\n愿言住庵人，万事付衲被。\n食肉尸陀林，渠自有正味。\n但怀不退转，便到佛地位。\n请参诗中禅，一语当千倡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20675,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乙酉正月二十日游慈云三首 其一","author":"陈著","text":"数曲清溪山抱回，青山高处醉筵开。\n忽然鼓笛太平调，便是洞庭闻乐来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20676,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丁丑五月六日醵饮茂林偶成","author":"陈著","text":"夹路松杉护午阴，南风吹透树中心。\n一声婆饼焦何处，妙法莲花此妙音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20677,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九月一日戴时可酒边 其一","author":"陈著","text":"老夫不是不知时，黄菊芙蓉正要诗。\n谁信多魔儿女病，催租风雨又攒眉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20678,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九月一日戴时可酒边 其二","author":"陈著","text":"不知今日是何时，只管飞毫醉梦诗。\n天地本来宽著我，可曾寒饿一低眉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20679,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"儿童以石舟戏于池","author":"陈著","text":"浮生已付四宜休，老病光阴黄叶秋。\n底用燕嬉居画舫，何妨飘忽悟虚舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20680,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八字桥","author":"陈著","text":"二灵山下湖光润，八字桥头河水分。\n此是江东最佳处，近来风景不堪闻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20681,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又次韵二首 其二","author":"陈著","text":"赋诗谁复待沈香，澒洞乾坤走险忙。\n寂寂春光伤感处，瘦来不是沈东阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20682,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又次韵二首 其一","author":"陈著","text":"犹记年时花下醉，老怀今已不成春。\n深黄浅紫知何在，留得残莺啼向人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20683,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又次韵帅初诸前七首 其七","author":"陈著","text":"君是能诗犹可及，及君不可是吾年。\n有怀伐木相求意，但诵投瓜永好篇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20684,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又次韵帅初诸前七首 其六","author":"陈著","text":"荷衣萧飒甘谋拙，毡笠峥嵘任命通。\n祇为爱山忙入剡，不因思鲙始归东。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20685,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又次韵帅初诸前七首 其五","author":"陈著","text":"幻景为生何短长，痴人得梦亦推详。\n餐英漫效独清屈，饮乳谁皆百世苍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20686,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又次韵帅初诸前七首 其四","author":"陈著","text":"世上纷纷博一卢，案头矻矻守三馀。\n牢辞门外鸡豚社，菜味深长手灌锄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20687,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又次韵帅初诸前七首 其三","author":"陈著","text":"世机毒甚含沙蜮，民命危于减水鱼。\n幸有柴门自深闭，不妨窗下蠹残书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20688,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又次韵帅初诸前七首 其二","author":"陈著","text":"青春本是耐官劳，却入山居便养高。\n清话一閒甜蚁梦，黄尘万事等鸿毛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20689,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又次韵帅初诸前七首 其一","author":"陈著","text":"三閒老屋坐屏山，梅影横斜细竹斑。\n寡欲自能坚铁脊，长生何必问金丹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20690,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三次前韵二首 其二","author":"陈著","text":"花本伤时不肯香，酒无赊处亦空忙。\n便逢花酒如何醉，回首凄烟锁景阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20691,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三次前韵二首 其一","author":"陈著","text":"东风吹送世閒尘，斜日消凝洛下春。\n谁料马蹄成怪事，旁观自有豫知人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20692,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上巳酒边即事示女冲二首 其二","author":"陈著","text":"年华浮动酒中心，笑向吾前满满斟。\n犹喜家贫诗礼在，一杯真率胜山阴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20693,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上巳酒边即事示女冲二首 其一","author":"陈著","text":"女冲踏露折棠花，引得儿童哄一家。\n说道今朝修禊日，暂抛针线答年华。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20694,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与西寺月石桥二首 其二","author":"陈著","text":"相逢相约到云閒，欲往从人却又还。\n留取有馀无尽意，眼中处处见西山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20695,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与西寺月石桥二首 其一","author":"陈著","text":"脊梁硬竖支撑佛，心地平铺济渡人。\n不比天台无用物，祇将奇险诳愚民。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20696,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与弟侄观小圃梅花二首 其二","author":"陈著","text":"是则看花要及时，看花到实不妨迟。\n前贤亦有留佳句，绿叶成阴子满枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20697,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与弟侄观小圃梅花二首 其一","author":"陈著","text":"看花须看未开时，到七分开看已迟。\n前辈咏梅多此意，水边竹外两三枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20698,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与徐国英坐西窗渴睡中得四句","author":"陈著","text":"古语相宜数日陪，西风未放木犀开。\n子方兴尽欲归去，小雨又从溪外来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20699,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"小学识愧 其二","author":"陈著","text":"指点方名屑训蒙，一方才解四方通。\n定知第一番开说，万水朝宗是正东。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20700,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"小学识愧 其一","author":"陈著","text":"字画向来虽小技，儿时欲学亦难详。\n点妆但莫如新妇，端正终须自老苍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20701,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"小学识愧 其三","author":"陈著","text":"工夫靠里方为学，时习奚分幼壮年。\n何幸席閒提掇紧，最明新处是陈篇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20702,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"小宴偶成","author":"陈著","text":"小宴珊瑚月未明，满堂欢笑杂蛙声。\n明朝此会知谁续，试把镫花仔细评。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20703,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元夕应人求题酒肆镫","author":"陈著","text":"镫花三五夜，鼓笛十分春。\n欲见太平事，谁非沈醉人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20704,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元宵薇山内弟酒边五首 其三","author":"陈著","text":"火是人生日用资，难凭回禄做儿嬉。\n千镫照夜成何事，一点疏防万屋危。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20705,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元宵薇山内弟酒边五首 其二","author":"陈著","text":"镫宵处处是春台，尽夜还家亦快哉。\n说与诸儿此行好，满襟带得义风回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20706,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元宵薇山内弟酒边五首 其一","author":"陈著","text":"青镫连夜得论情，瓦缶方淫独古声。\n人意好时天亦应，满山风雨忽开晴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20707,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"午景书怀","author":"陈著","text":"虚斋檐马自丁东，却在莺啼燕语中。\n整屐欲寻花信息，不知柳絮已随风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20708,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王得淦招饮席上二首 其二","author":"陈著","text":"太史应须奏德星，老夫相与證高情。\n杯盘楚楚饶诗兴，写出人閒淡处声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20709,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王得淦招饮席上二首 其一","author":"陈著","text":"亲戚疏疏已晓星，杯中滴滴是真情。\n近来此酒谁家有，除却旗亭无笑声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20710,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丙戌人日与内侄汪景渊同饮于宜晚二首 其二","author":"陈著","text":"危世相逢三载閒，春风杯酒此时难。\n双溪不是无风月，世味何如菜芋盘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20711,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]